agent object-storage 0.0.19

This is the agent's published contract, pinned by commit. It is input to
`codefly generate proto`, never edited here: to move the pin, change the SHA
above, re-extract and regenerate.

The agent exports no API contract catalog of its own today, so
`codefly generate client --from datasource/storage` cannot resolve it
("service storage has no proto/buf.yaml"). That is the gap this pin stands in
for; when the agent publishes its catalog, this directory goes away.
